    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 50 new plugins and the official repo gained 289 stars, led by Ebony-Vinyl/dsh-our-free-model (+1168) and dataelement/dsh-desktop (+232). Ecosystem health scored 38/100, with 14,921 of 18,701 non-fork plugins stale for 7+ days, so activity is worth tracking more than total count.",
